WEBVTT

00:19.560 --> 00:20.600
<b>It feels good.</b>

00:24.940 --> 00:27.270
<b>You know, Momoka…</b>

01:59.610 --> 02:03.950
<b>**THE CENTER OF THE WORLD**</b>

02:01.570 --> 02:03.950
<b>You're too close. We're on top of each other!</b>

02:04.410 --> 02:05.830
<b>Hang in there.</b>

02:06.960 --> 02:10.040
<b>Why are we cooped up in here, anyway?</b>

02:10.380 --> 02:12.840
<b>Because the other rooms are taken.</b>

02:13.500 --> 02:16.840
<b>The studio we used is free, though.</b>

02:17.300 --> 02:18.840
<b>But it's expensive to rent.</b>

02:19.010 --> 02:22.390
<b>Are we going to manage? The festival is so close.</b>

02:24.720 --> 02:28.350
<b>"Are we going to manage? The festival is so close."</b>

02:31.400 --> 02:32.900
<b>We're wasting time here.</b>

02:33.190 --> 02:35.360
<b>So, what do you think of the song?</b>

02:35.940 --> 02:38.240
<b>I start where you said, right?</b>

02:38.490 --> 02:39.570
<b>Will you give me the tempo?</b>

02:40.530 --> 02:41.280
<b>Sure.</b>

02:41.740 --> 02:44.830
<b>- Are we really keeping this part?
- I'm wondering about that.</b>

02:44.990 --> 02:46.830
<b>I prefer the song as it is.</b>

02:47.000 --> 02:50.120
<b>Both versions work; it's up to Momoka to decide.</b>

02:50.790 --> 02:51.620
<b>So?</b>

02:52.040 --> 02:55.210
<b>It's hard to say since we're all playing at the same time.</b>

02:55.670 --> 02:58.880
<b>Let's do it again without my guitar.</b>

02:59.380 --> 03:00.630
<b>From the last chorus.</b>

03:01.970 --> 03:02.640
<b>OK!</b>

03:03.970 --> 03:04.640
<b>I'm exhausted.</b>

03:05.100 --> 03:08.270
<b>But no, Burton Sister is closing the festival!</b>

03:08.430 --> 03:09.140
<b>Really?</b>

03:09.390 --> 03:10.640
<b>What, are you a fan?</b>

03:11.350 --> 03:12.230
<b>Not really…</b>

03:12.480 --> 03:14.310
<b>A bunch of handsome guys.</b>

03:14.480 --> 03:16.020
<b>I don't care about that band.</b>

03:16.480 --> 03:18.570
<b>Look, there's our name!</b>

03:18.740 --> 03:21.030
<b>Well, of course. We're performing too.</b>

03:21.490 --> 03:23.160
<b>We're playing on the first day?</b>

03:23.320 --> 03:25.530
<b>Yes, we're kicking things off.</b>

03:26.080 --> 03:28.450
<b>So we can enjoy the last concert.</b>

03:28.620 --> 03:30.460
<b>And that live show, and that one too…</b>

03:30.620 --> 03:32.710
<b>Because you're going to see them all?</b>

03:33.080 --> 03:34.500
<b>Of course.</b>

03:34.750 --> 03:36.540
<b>We get in for free, might as well enjoy it.</b>

03:36.960 --> 03:39.340
<b>How many people will be there?</b>

03:39.510 --> 03:42.050
<b>It's a festival, so it varies a lot.</b>

03:42.550 --> 03:44.890
<b>It'll be packed for the headliners</b>

03:45.050 --> 03:47.060
<b>and empty for the unknowns.</b>

03:47.430 --> 03:50.310
<b>And that's where we're supposed to prove ourselves?</b>

03:53.060 --> 03:55.060
<b>- Exactly…
- Hi, girls!</b>

03:55.480 --> 03:59.570
<b>Apparently, your performance date has changed.</b>

04:00.070 --> 04:01.320
<b>Hold on tight.</b>

04:03.530 --> 04:06.320
<b>- We might be playing on the second day.
- What?</b>

04:06.740 --> 04:09.830
<b>Well, one of the bands had to cancel.</b>

04:10.000 --> 04:14.580
<b>We'll be on the same stage but at a different time.</b>

04:15.830 --> 04:17.540
<b>It lasts all night.</b>

04:17.710 --> 04:20.800
<b>Which means we'll have a bigger audience.</b>

04:20.960 --> 04:22.340
<b>That's perfect!</b>

04:22.510 --> 04:24.340
<b>Is that alright with you?</b>

04:25.470 --> 04:28.850
<b>I feel like everything is going our way.</b>

04:33.850 --> 04:35.900
<b>Do you have a moment?</b>

04:38.610 --> 04:40.400
<b>- Wait, isn't that…
- Yep.</b>

04:40.650 --> 04:44.360
<b>I thought it was a good idea to do a little scouting.</b>

04:44.780 --> 04:46.910
<b>Are we going to play in such a huge place?</b>

04:47.320 --> 04:50.160
<b>- No, that's the main stage.
- The main one?</b>

04:50.660 --> 04:54.000
<b>We'll be on the smaller stage, much more modest.</b>

04:54.710 --> 04:56.170
<b>There are several stages?</b>

04:56.750 --> 04:58.790
<b>You really know nothing.</b>

04:59.500 --> 05:01.340
<b>The stars play on the big one,</b>

05:01.550 --> 05:03.800
<b>and the lesser-known ones on the small one.</b>

05:04.220 --> 05:06.800
<b>Diamond Dust is playing on the big stage, of course.</b>

05:11.220 --> 05:13.310
<b>I'm really super happy.</b>

05:13.730 --> 05:15.810
<b>It looks so impressive.</b>

05:16.350 --> 05:18.480
<b>We're going to challenge the giant Diamond Dust</b>

05:18.730 --> 05:21.820
<b>from our little stage.</b>

05:22.280 --> 05:25.070
<b>- Like in <i>Giant Killing.</i>
- Still waters run deep.</b>

05:25.240 --> 05:26.150
<b>Don't get carried away.</b>

05:26.320 --> 05:28.820
<b>Neither the band nor the fans think that way.</b>

05:29.870 --> 05:32.410
<b>But we do. Momoka and I.</b>

05:33.240 --> 05:36.120
<b>Are you sure this change doesn't bother you?</b>

05:37.580 --> 05:38.540
<b>Is it okay with you?</b>

05:41.960 --> 05:42.500
<b>Perfect.</b>

05:43.760 --> 05:47.090
<b>It's going to be great, playing under a starry sky.</b>

05:49.010 --> 05:50.550
<b>Momoka!</b>

05:51.260 --> 05:53.850
<b>Lend me a guitar for the fest!</b>

05:54.390 --> 05:56.730
<b>Well, I'm off to work!</b>

05:58.190 --> 05:59.940
<b>Huh? Weren't you working together?</b>

06:00.150 --> 06:02.820
<b>Yes, but she found</b>

06:02.980 --> 06:05.240
<b>a second job.</b>

06:06.400 --> 06:09.490
<b>I don't know if she's selfish or just headstrong.</b>

06:10.070 --> 06:12.990
<b>She wants to give herself the means to succeed.</b>

06:13.370 --> 06:16.500
<b>Still, she's come a long way, hasn't she?</b>

06:17.040 --> 06:19.250
<b>But does she know how to play the guitar?</b>

06:19.670 --> 06:20.380
<b>Well…</b>

06:24.170 --> 06:26.010
<b>**FROM: TENDO AWA**</b>

06:24.920 --> 06:25.630
<b>Seriously.</b>

06:26.510 --> 06:28.880
<b>Not everyone has that luck.</b>

06:30.260 --> 06:30.890
<b>She gets on my nerves.</b>

06:33.680 --> 06:34.510
<b><i>Liar.</i></b>

06:37.770 --> 06:39.020
<b>I'm not a liar.</b>

06:45.980 --> 06:49.780
<b>I think Subaru hasn't told anyone about the band.</b>

06:50.240 --> 06:52.700
<b>I love that side of your personality.</b>

06:53.530 --> 06:55.120
<b>I don't care, really.</b>

06:55.660 --> 06:58.830
<b>I hope one day, things will calm down between you.</b>

07:00.540 --> 07:02.040
<b>I doubt it.</b>

07:02.630 --> 07:04.590
<b>You never know what the future holds.</b>

07:05.710 --> 07:06.550
<b>It's impossible.</b>

07:07.170 --> 07:09.720
<b>At least they're within your reach.</b>

07:12.470 --> 07:16.390
<b>You may not see them anymore, but they're alive.</b>

07:17.470 --> 07:19.560
<b>The people I love</b>

07:20.020 --> 07:22.520
<b>have turned to mere ashes.</b>

07:24.020 --> 07:25.400
<b>But you have me.</b>

07:27.690 --> 07:28.530
<b>Thank you.</b>

07:30.650 --> 07:32.160
<b><i>Why do I make music?</i></b>

07:32.320 --> 07:36.450
<b><i>Probably because it allows me to connect with others.</i></b>

07:40.080 --> 07:42.830
<b><i>Because it helps me be myself.</i></b>

07:44.790 --> 07:45.840
<b><i>Let's see…</i></b>

07:46.210 --> 07:48.840
<b><i>I can forget everything and finally feel free.</i></b>

07:56.100 --> 07:57.010
<b><i>For me…</i></b>

07:59.020 --> 08:01.270
<b><i>it's a way to prove I'm right.</i></b>

08:03.560 --> 08:05.360
<b>That's a lot of people.</b>

08:05.730 --> 08:08.020
<b>The serious stuff is about to begin.</b>

08:08.530 --> 08:09.530
<b>Who are you?</b>

08:09.860 --> 08:12.110
<b>Toge Toge. Togenashi Togeari.</b>

08:12.490 --> 08:15.450
<b>Oh, I remember you. Park over there.</b>

08:17.370 --> 08:20.870
<b>- Are we playing in the evening?
- Yeah, watch the time.</b>

08:21.370 --> 08:23.620
<b>We'll be able to watch a few concerts.</b>

08:24.120 --> 08:25.880
<b>What? But it's the big day!</b>

08:26.330 --> 08:29.960
<b>Maybe, but seeing other bands can give us a boost.</b>

08:30.260 --> 08:32.170
<b>But don't be late.</b>

08:32.340 --> 08:33.300
<b>Promise!</b>

08:33.470 --> 08:34.880
<b>Can I come with you?</b>

08:35.340 --> 08:37.140
<b>No way!</b>

08:37.850 --> 08:38.510
<b>Mean.</b>

08:39.890 --> 08:42.230
<b>Is this our dressing room?</b>

08:42.390 --> 08:43.180
<b>You could say that.</b>

08:43.810 --> 08:44.810
<b>**TOGENASHI TOGEARI**</b>

08:44.190 --> 08:44.810
<b>Hi!</b>

08:46.230 --> 08:47.310
<b>You came!</b>

08:47.860 --> 08:48.690
<b>Mine?</b>

08:50.030 --> 08:51.690
<b>- Is this a bad time?
- On the contrary.</b>

08:51.860 --> 08:53.110
<b>Happy to see you again.</b>

08:53.530 --> 08:55.700
<b>- Hello.
- It's been a while.</b>

08:55.990 --> 08:57.820
<b>You could have given me a heads-up.</b>

08:58.280 --> 08:59.910
<b>It would have ruined the surprise.</b>

09:00.080 --> 09:03.960
<b>Still, it's no small thing to play on the second day at that time!</b>

09:04.580 --> 09:06.080
<b>That's kind, thank you.</b>

09:06.540 --> 09:08.420
<b>But it was just luck.</b>

09:09.790 --> 09:11.420
<b>And you, how are you?</b>

09:11.590 --> 09:14.220
<b>Good, but my guitar skills still need work.</b>

09:16.180 --> 09:16.930
<b>That's good.</b>

09:17.760 --> 09:19.970
<b>You seem more and more comfortable.</b>

09:20.390 --> 09:21.350
<b>Really?</b>

09:22.060 --> 09:23.770
<b>Yes, you look like a real singer.</b>

09:24.100 --> 09:24.730
<b>Awesome.</b>

09:27.270 --> 09:29.190
<b>Are you done chatting?</b>

09:29.810 --> 09:31.610
<b>Introduce me, come on.</b>

09:32.780 --> 09:33.280
<b>Yo.</b>

09:35.110 --> 09:36.240
<b>Everyone take cover!</b>

09:36.610 --> 09:37.820
<b>Ah, sorry.</b>

09:38.110 --> 09:39.320
<b>This is Kyoko.</b>

09:40.370 --> 09:41.740
<b>What a small world!</b>

09:42.450 --> 09:43.330
<b>Hi.</b>

09:43.500 --> 09:44.540
<b>Hello.</b>

09:44.790 --> 09:47.500
<b>For your information, she's a big fan.</b>

09:49.500 --> 09:51.670
<b>Yeah, I love your voice.</b>

09:51.880 --> 09:54.760
<b>We should do another session together sometime.</b>

09:55.720 --> 09:57.260
<b>If you’ll have me…</b>

09:57.720 --> 10:00.220
<b>You’re up for it? Awesome!</b>

10:01.050 --> 10:02.760
<b>A photo to commemorate this?</b>

10:03.220 --> 10:04.520
<b>Make a funny face.</b>

10:05.140 --> 10:06.060
<b>A funny face?</b>

10:06.230 --> 10:08.100
<b>You too, girls.</b>

10:08.270 --> 10:09.270
<b>Huh? Why?</b>

10:09.690 --> 10:10.650
<b>Ready?</b>

10:11.230 --> 10:12.610
<b>Come on, smile!</b>

10:13.730 --> 10:15.780
<b>You all look so silly.</b>

10:15.940 --> 10:19.570
<b>It's not nice that you two ditched us.</b>

10:20.950 --> 10:22.780
<b>We got a bunch of "likes."</b>

10:23.030 --> 10:24.240
<b>And comments.</b>

10:24.410 --> 10:26.450
<b>Saying they can't wait to see us.</b>

10:26.790 --> 10:28.370
<b>We’re finally getting noticed.</b>

10:29.580 --> 10:31.460
<b>It's all-you-can-drink!</b>

10:31.920 --> 10:33.170
<b>Lucky.</b>

10:33.340 --> 10:34.800
<b>Cheers!</b>

10:34.960 --> 10:35.840
<b>Stop.</b>

10:36.340 --> 10:37.380
<b>Just one sip.</b>

10:37.550 --> 10:40.090
<b>You never stop at just one.</b>

10:41.180 --> 10:42.430
<b>Oh, Miura!</b>

10:44.220 --> 10:46.100
<b>You’re Miura, right?</b>

10:47.180 --> 10:48.940
<b>Wrong person!</b>

10:49.190 --> 10:50.980
<b>Huh? Did I mess up?</b>

10:51.770 --> 10:53.520
<b>- Bottoms up!
- No.</b>

10:54.360 --> 10:57.110
<b>Meanwhile, still no sign of Subaru.</b>

10:57.610 --> 10:59.610
<b>She must be listening to someone or other.</b>

11:00.070 --> 11:02.370
<b>It's not fair. I would have liked that too.</b>

11:02.740 --> 11:04.990
<b>She's back in the dressing room.</b>

11:05.160 --> 11:06.080
<b>Really?</b>

11:06.240 --> 11:06.950
<b>No entry.</b>

11:08.290 --> 11:10.000
<b>**TOGENASHI TOGEARI**</b>

11:09.160 --> 11:11.000
<b>- Subaru.
- Yo.</b>

11:11.500 --> 11:13.710
<b>So, did you catch some sets?</b>

11:14.630 --> 11:15.130
<b>Yeah.</b>

11:15.550 --> 11:18.130
<b>Lucky. I would have loved to go.</b>

11:19.260 --> 11:20.720
<b>You’re the lucky one.</b>

11:22.140 --> 11:23.850
<b>Not everyone can move on.</b>

11:24.930 --> 11:25.890
<b>Are you okay?</b>

11:26.560 --> 11:29.310
<b>You know, the first time I went to a festival,</b>

11:29.560 --> 11:32.230
<b>a drummer said something that stuck with me.</b>

11:32.770 --> 11:35.570
<b>That he always saw the backs of the other members.</b>

11:36.400 --> 11:39.650
<b>At the time, it really resonated with me,</b>

11:39.820 --> 11:42.160
<b>because I feel the same way.</b>

11:43.110 --> 11:44.160
<b>Subaru…</b>

11:44.620 --> 11:46.830
<b>I sent a message to my grandmother.</b>

11:47.790 --> 11:48.660
<b>What did you say?</b>

11:50.080 --> 11:53.670
<b>That I wanted to do something other than comedy.</b>

11:54.380 --> 11:54.920
<b>Seriously?</b>

11:55.500 --> 11:58.800
<b>So yeah, we need to keep this band alive.</b>

11:59.380 --> 12:00.720
<b>Even if we mess up here.</b>

12:01.970 --> 12:02.760
<b>Are you sure?</b>

12:03.010 --> 12:07.850
<b>You're the kind of stubborn girl who always does her own thing.</b>

12:08.060 --> 12:12.600
<b>You're shy and not good with people. The kind who gets bullied.</b>

12:13.060 --> 12:15.190
<b>And on top of that, you can't lie.</b>

12:15.560 --> 12:19.150
<b>But you always give it your all.</b>

12:19.320 --> 12:21.440
<b>I want to see where you'll take us.</b>

12:22.530 --> 12:23.360
<b>Thanks.</b>

12:23.910 --> 12:25.030
<b>I'm just messing with you.</b>

12:26.160 --> 12:27.240
<b>You liar.</b>

12:30.660 --> 12:31.370
<b>Come on.</b>

12:32.410 --> 12:33.330
<b>Momoka?</b>

12:33.790 --> 12:34.540
<b>But where?</b>

12:35.460 --> 12:36.790
<b>Just follow me.</b>

12:39.130 --> 12:42.510
<b>- It’s really huge.
- Well, it's the main stage.</b>

12:42.920 --> 12:44.260
<b>The crowd has grown.</b>

12:44.430 --> 12:46.050
<b>Can you see anything?</b>

12:46.300 --> 12:48.010
<b>No, and I hate it.</b>

12:48.390 --> 12:49.890
<b>Do you want me to lift you up?</b>

12:52.270 --> 12:55.730
<b>I see it's become a reflex for you too.</b>

12:56.810 --> 12:57.730
<b>It's starting.</b>

12:58.730 --> 12:59.770
<b>This song…</b>

13:00.980 --> 13:02.280
<b>Yes, it’s the one.</b>

13:03.280 --> 13:04.150
<b>Momoka.</b>

13:06.740 --> 13:09.780
<b><i>Thanks for the warm welcome!</i></b>

13:10.290 --> 13:13.200
<b><i>For those who don’t know us, we’re…</i></b>

13:13.710 --> 13:15.620
<b><i>Diamond Dust!</i></b>

13:17.330 --> 13:19.790
<b><i>Stay with us!</i></b>

13:22.960 --> 13:25.630
<b><i>Are you going to play the victim forever?</i></b>

13:26.380 --> 13:27.800
<b><i>You were wrong.</i></b>

13:32.220 --> 13:34.310
<b><i>You’re heading straight for disaster.</i></b>

13:34.980 --> 13:37.020
<b><i>You must be an idiot.</i></b>

13:39.270 --> 13:40.480
<b><i>Shut up.</i></b>

13:49.280 --> 13:50.870
<b><i>Here we go!</i></b>

14:13.930 --> 14:20.650
<b><i>At the edge of the world where everything begins</i></b>

14:20.900 --> 14:24.150
<b><i>Only doubt dances</i></b>

14:24.320 --> 14:29.200
<b><i>Boredom only multiplies</i></b>

14:29.360 --> 14:34.370
<b><i>Living in an unfinished dream</i></b>

14:34.540 --> 14:36.870
<b><i>I laugh, completely cornered</i></b>

14:37.160 --> 14:42.040
<b><i>Ready to unleash myself to support your sharp gaze</i></b>

14:42.210 --> 14:44.670
<b><i>But it will never be enough</i></b>

14:44.840 --> 14:49.840
<b><i>Those who lack the courage to shout often reap all the laurels</i></b>

14:50.010 --> 14:55.100
<b><i>A prayer for those who have changed</i></b>

14:55.270 --> 14:57.640
<b><i>I will continue to scream again and again</i></b>

14:57.810 --> 15:04.520
<b><i>Even a prisoner of the chains of a cruel destiny</i></b>

15:04.690 --> 15:08.190
<b><i>In a different cycle of desperate sadness</i></b>

15:23.380 --> 15:24.790
<b><i>Thank you very much!</i></b>

15:26.130 --> 15:29.470
<b><i>- Good evening, everyone!
- We see you, those in the back!</i></b>

15:30.130 --> 15:31.470
<b>They're getting better.</b>

15:31.630 --> 15:32.510
<b>It's true.</b>

15:32.680 --> 15:34.350
<b>They took a lot of flak</b>

15:34.510 --> 15:38.480
<b>when they chose an <i>idol</i> as their singer.</b>

15:39.020 --> 15:41.440
<b>But now, they're sending a strong message.</b>

15:41.600 --> 15:44.980
<b>That they shouldn't be underestimated, that they can surprise.</b>

15:48.110 --> 15:51.780
<b>And the fans have understood that. They're not laughing anymore.</b>

16:00.460 --> 16:03.210
<b>- They're going to fight, huh.
- I'm drunk now.</b>

16:03.380 --> 16:05.250
<b>I love this kind of challenge.</b>

16:05.420 --> 16:10.260
<b>We're going to steal all their fans, every last one.</b>

16:11.220 --> 16:11.800
<b>Yeah.</b>

16:12.590 --> 16:16.300
<b><i>Togenashi Togeari for sound check, thank you!</i></b>

16:16.600 --> 16:17.140
<b>OK!</b>

16:21.180 --> 16:22.190
<b>Wow.</b>

16:24.940 --> 16:27.520
<b><i>Alright, starting with the drums.</i></b>

16:27.690 --> 16:28.270
<b>Alright!</b>

16:53.550 --> 16:55.430
<b><i>OK, we're good.</i></b>

16:55.890 --> 16:57.600
<b><i>And now, the microphone.</i></b>

16:57.760 --> 16:58.640
<b>OK!</b>

17:02.520 --> 17:04.230
<b><i>Perfect, thank you.</i></b>

17:04.390 --> 17:07.060
<b><i>Thank you! That's great!</i></b>

17:07.480 --> 17:10.730
<b><i>Alright, now the bass.</i></b>

17:10.900 --> 17:12.190
<b><i>Alright.</i></b>

17:32.130 --> 17:34.630
<b><i>Great. Do you use pedals?</i></b>

17:34.880 --> 17:36.470
<b><i>Yes, distortion.</i></b>

17:46.900 --> 17:48.730
<b><i>And nothing else?</i></b>

17:49.230 --> 17:50.270
<b><i>No.</i></b>

17:52.940 --> 17:54.360
<b>It's almost our turn.</b>

17:54.690 --> 17:57.410
<b>- A little pick-me-up…
- We said no alcohol!</b>

17:58.240 --> 18:00.120
<b>By the way, where's Miura?</b>

18:00.280 --> 18:05.120
<b>**NEW TANTANMEN RAMEN**</b>

18:00.530 --> 18:03.700
<b>She sent me a message. She'll be in the audience.</b>

18:03.870 --> 18:05.120
<b>She's not coming to see us?</b>

18:05.290 --> 18:08.630
<b>I like that she keeps her distance. It feels more professional.</b>

18:09.080 --> 18:10.840
<b>- Not sure that's the reason.
- So cool!</b>

18:12.000 --> 18:15.260
<b>Togenashi Togeari. It's your turn to go on stage!</b>

18:15.670 --> 18:16.220
<b>OK.</b>

18:17.550 --> 18:19.510
<b>Well, how about a hug?</b>

18:19.720 --> 18:20.390
<b>No way.</b>

18:21.390 --> 18:24.770
<b>What if… we just raise our pinkies?</b>

18:25.480 --> 18:26.270
<b>Good idea.</b>

18:27.940 --> 18:28.600
<b>Totally.</b>

18:30.690 --> 18:31.270
<b>That's lame.</b>

18:32.020 --> 18:35.650
<b>We're going to give the most important concert of our lives.</b>

18:36.320 --> 18:40.410
<b>Nina, you have to sing with all your might and shout at the top of your lungs.</b>

18:40.660 --> 18:43.660
<b>Electrify the crowd with your emotions.</b>

18:45.750 --> 18:46.330
<b>Promise.</b>

18:46.500 --> 18:48.420
<b>Oh no! You made her cry!</b>

18:48.580 --> 18:50.790
<b>Get a grip, we're about to play!</b>

18:59.800 --> 19:01.390
<b><i>I don't know how to play!</i></b>

19:05.020 --> 19:06.220
<b>Nonsense.</b>

19:06.560 --> 19:07.180
<b>Idiot.</b>

19:07.730 --> 19:08.850
<b>Now that's rock.</b>

19:09.560 --> 19:12.940
<b><i>Uh, well… nice to meet you. We're Togenashi Togeari.</i></b>

19:13.270 --> 19:15.190
<b><i>A brand-new band.</i></b>

19:16.070 --> 19:19.780
<b><i>And honestly, starting out is not easy.</i></b>

19:19.950 --> 19:24.410
<b><i>We're the reserved type, a bit wary and withdrawn.</i></b>

19:24.580 --> 19:27.450
<b><i>Sometimes, we don't even give 100%.</i></b>

19:28.080 --> 19:29.790
<b><i>Are you talking about me?</i></b>

19:29.960 --> 19:31.790
<b><i>Who's the withdrawn one?</i></b>

19:31.960 --> 19:33.590
<b><i>Well, I'm telling the truth!</i></b>

19:33.750 --> 19:34.630
<b><i>Alright, that's enough.</i></b>

19:34.790 --> 19:37.760
<b><i>Momoka on guitar and Tomo on keyboards!</i></b>

19:37.920 --> 19:41.340
<b><i>Here's our modest singer, Nina!</i></b>

19:41.630 --> 19:43.930
<b><i>And finally, Rupa on bass!</i></b>

19:44.100 --> 19:45.760
<b><i>Long live the arguments!</i></b>

19:46.510 --> 19:49.060
<b><i>And on drums, here's…</i></b>

19:49.850 --> 19:51.640
<b><i>Subaru!</i></b>

19:53.860 --> 19:55.980
<b><i>"Forget it. It will never happen.</i></b>

19:56.570 --> 19:58.940
<b><i>"It's impossible. Be realistic.</i></b>

19:59.110 --> 20:00.450
<b><i>"Consider yourself lucky.</i></b>

20:01.030 --> 20:02.610
<b><i>"It's hard for me too."</i></b>

20:03.410 --> 20:06.620
<b><i>And that's how reality tried to drown me,</i></b>

20:06.910 --> 20:08.870
<b><i>with a smile.</i></b>

20:10.580 --> 20:13.330
<b><i>I wrote this song to free myself.</i></b>

20:14.040 --> 20:14.830
<b><i>But also…</i></b>

20:15.710 --> 20:18.630
<b><i>to turn skeptics into believers.</i></b>

20:19.260 --> 20:22.130
<b><i>To all those who put me down…</i></b>

20:22.680 --> 20:25.140
<b><i>I want to shout that I'm still standing!</i></b>

20:25.850 --> 20:28.260
<b><i>No matter what I achieve</i></b>

20:28.430 --> 20:33.100
<b><i>How I manage and to what extent To what extent, to what extent</i></b>

20:33.270 --> 20:39.650
<b><i>I'm never good enough</i></b>

20:45.070 --> 20:50.200
<b><i>What's more pathetic than discouraging your peers</i></b>

20:50.370 --> 20:55.880
<b><i>Everyone wants to believe they're indispensable</i></b>

20:56.040 --> 20:58.960
<b><i>The reason is clear</i></b>

20:59.130 --> 21:04.630
<b><i>To shatter the void</i></b>

21:05.640 --> 21:10.470
<b><i>Once you look at things through rose-colored glasses</i></b>

21:10.770 --> 21:15.690
<b><i>Everything seems to brighten up</i></b>

21:15.850 --> 21:20.820
<b><i>And what we've always wanted starts to blur</i></b>

21:20.980 --> 21:23.450
<b><i>I don't want to die anymore I want to live fully</i></b>

21:23.610 --> 21:26.110
<b><i>I swore it My soul screams it to the point of exhaustion</i></b>

21:26.280 --> 21:31.200
<b><i>Nothing can stop this delirious fever</i></b>

21:31.370 --> 21:33.710
<b><i>Unforgivable and pathetic</i></b>

21:33.870 --> 21:36.500
<b><i>Everything is gradually becoming detestable</i></b>

21:36.960 --> 21:46.800
<b><i>I hide my tears as best I can</i></b>

21:52.100 --> 21:57.150
<b><i>What's more infuriating than forcing yourself to be obedient</i></b>

21:55.140 --> 21:57.150
<b>**THE ANGER OF BEING ALONE**</b>

21:57.520 --> 22:02.980
<b><i>A silent rebellion is a form of emancipation</i></b>

22:03.150 --> 22:06.030
<b><i>Sad and abandoned</i></b>

22:06.200 --> 22:12.200
<b><i>I kicked away the painful exile</i></b>

22:07.070 --> 22:09.620
<b>**THE JOY THAT I LOST**</b>

22:12.740 --> 22:17.670
<b><i>An empty heart incapable of crying</i></b>

22:16.080 --> 22:17.670
<b>**AND THE SADNESS OF A LIE**</b>

22:17.870 --> 22:22.800
<b><i>I make myself forgettable, my voice now muzzled</i></b>

22:21.840 --> 22:22.800
<b>**IN THIS SONG**</b>

22:22.960 --> 22:27.970
<b><i>What I want to reach has faded, slowly evaporated</i></b>

22:26.590 --> 22:27.970
<b>**EVERYTHING**</b>

22:28.260 --> 22:30.930
<b>**PUT EVERYTHING YOU FEEL INTO IT**</b>

22:46.280 --> 22:51.370
<b><i>And what we've always wanted starts to blur</i></b>

22:59.120 --> 23:01.460
<b><i>I want to survive Destroy everything</i></b>

23:01.630 --> 23:04.130
<b><i>A confused and distorted turmoil</i></b>

23:04.300 --> 23:09.260
<b><i>The most nebulous of transparencies Amazes once reduced to ashes</i></b>

23:09.430 --> 23:11.890
<b><i>Pathetic, pathetic Everything is detestable</i></b>

23:12.050 --> 23:14.930
<b><i>Meaningless words, wheezing breath Goodbye rancid ideas</i></b>

23:12.050 --> 23:12.550
<b><i>Dropped out of school</i></b>

23:15.100 --> 23:22.810
<b><i>Terrified of resisting</i></b>

23:24.230 --> 23:30.160
<b><i>Terrified of resisting</i></b>

23:33.950 --> 23:35.330
<b>**VOID AND CATHARSIS**</b>

23:38.290 --> 23:39.830
<b>That was amazing!</b>

23:41.420 --> 23:42.080
<b>Momoka.</b>

23:42.670 --> 23:45.170
<b>I'm not wrong, am I?</b>

23:47.840 --> 23:49.840
<b><i>Next: "And the sky darkens again."</i></b>
